        "type": "text",
        "text": "Some people can develop a condition called type 2 diabetes. In people with type 2 diabetes, glucose uptake from the blood is decreased. In some cases, the pancreas cannot make enough insulin to keep blood glucose concentration within a healthy range.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 16
        }
      }
    ],
